# Re-rendering a tier overwrites its MP4; `git status` would then show
# the file as modified on every re-render and tempt a commit of a
# re-encoded binary. The four MP4s that were checked in with the first
# render are already in git history, so clones get them -- this just
# keeps later re-renders out of the working tree's modified list.
*.mp4
# Per-tier work directories the pipeline creates and cleans up, but
# that are visible if a run is interrupted.
_*/
_*.log
